### 查所有图书
GET http://localhost:8080/books

### 新增一本图书
POST http://localhost:8080/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "百年孤独",
  "author": "马尔克斯",
  "status": "0"
}

### 修改 id=1 的图书
PUT http://localhost:8080/book/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java核心技术（第12版）",
  "author": "霍斯特曼",
  "status": "0"
}

### 删除 id=4 的图书
DELETE http://localhost:8080/book/4

### 查所有读者
GET http://localhost:8080/readers

### 新增读者
POST http://localhost:8080/reader
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "王五",
  "gender": "M",
  "phone": "13900000004"
}

### 修改 id=1 的读者
PUT http://localhost:8080/reader/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张语钦",
  "gender": "M",
  "phone": "13800000001"
}

### 删除 id=3 的读者
DELETE http://localhost:8080/reader/7









### 1. 借书：bookId=1 借给 readerId=1
POST http://localhost:8080/borrow/2/3

### 2. 再借同一本（应该报错"已经被借出去了"）
POST http://localhost:8080/borrow/1/3

### 3. 借书，但读者不存在 readerId=999（外键失败 → 事务回滚）
POST http://localhost:8080/borrow/2/999

### 4. 查 bookId=2 的状态（应该还是 "0"，证明第 3 步回滚成功了）
GET http://localhost:8080/book/2

### 5. 还书：bookId=1
PUT http://localhost:8080/return/1

### 6. 还一本没借出的书（应该报错"没有未归还的记录"）
PUT http://localhost:8080/return/3

###
GET http://localhost:8080/borrows?pageSize=100